<view class="container">
  <view class="header"><view class="title">自然发现</view><view class="subtitle">把今天的小发现，留在这里。</view></view>
  <view class="connection">本地体验 · 用户 {{identity}} · {{providerMode === 'real' ? '真实模型' : 'Mock 功能演示'}}<text wx:if="{{loading}}"> · 更新中</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{providerMode === 'mock'}}" class="model-notice">尚未连接真实模型。当前只有少量功能示例回复，无法体验完整的自由聊天语气。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{aiStatus.code === 'missing_credentials'}}" class="model-notice">模型配置尚未填写完整，暂时无法生成真实回复。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{aiStatus.code === 'insufficient_balance'}}" class="model-notice">模型账户余额不足，已停止请求。充值后重启本地服务即可继续体验。</view>
  <view class="tabs">
    <view class="tab {{view === 'public' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-view="public" bindtap="switchView">广场</view>
    <view class="tab {{view === 'mine' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-view="mine" bindtap="switchView">我的动态</view>
    <view class="tab {{view === 'local' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-view="local" bindtap="switchView">本机观察</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{view !== 'local'}}" class="composer">
    <textarea value="{{content}}" bindinput="updateContent" maxlength="600" placeholder="今天遇见了什么？没拍到，也可以聊聊。" auto-height disabled="{{sending}}" />
    <view wx:if="{{share}}" class="share-tag">分享观察：{{share.speciesName}}（用户记录，未经专业鉴定）<text bindtap="clearShare">　取消关联</text></view>
    <view class="notice">公开内容可能用于 AI 社区互动，可在“我的”关闭。照片与定位仅保存在本机，本次分享文字和物种信息。</view>
    <view class="memory-row"><text>允许这条动态及评论用于共享话题记忆</text><switch checked="{{memoryAllowed}}" bindchange="updateMemory" color="#2f6b4f" disabled="{{sending}}" /></view>
    <button class="publish" bindtap="publish" loading="{{sending}}" disabled="{{sending || !content}}">公开发布</button>
    <view class="notice">小黄偶尔串门，不保证回复；@ 也一样。草稿会留在本机。</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="retry">{{error}} · 点击重试</view>
  <block wx:if="{{view !== 'local'}}">
    <view wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" class="post-card">
      <view class="post-header"><view class="avatar">🌿</view><view class="user-info"><view class="username">{{item.displayName}}</view><view class="post-time">{{item.time}} · {{item.visibility === 'private' ? '仅自己可见' : '公开'}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{item.isMine}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="postMenu" class="more">•••</text></view>
      <view class="post-content">{{item.content}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.speciesName}}" class="share-tag">{{item.speciesName}} · 用户观察描述，未经专业鉴定</view>
      <view class="interaction-row" wx:if="{{item.visibility === 'public'}}">
        <view class="interaction-item {{item.liked ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleLike">{{item.liked ? '♥' : '♡'}} 赞 {{item.likeCount}}</view>
        <view class="interaction-item {{item.seen ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleSeen">我也见过 {{item.seenCount}}</view>
        <view class="interaction-item" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="addComment">评论 {{item.commentCount}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="comment-box" wx:if="{{item.comments.length}}">
        <view wx:for="{{item.comments}}" wx:for-item="comment" wx:key="id" class="comment-item">
          <view wx:if="{{comment.authorType === 'ai'}}" class="ai-avatar"></view>
          <view class="comment-body"><view><text class="comment-user">{{comment.displayName}}</text><text wx:if="{{comment.authorType === 'ai'}}" class="ai-badge">AI</text><text wx:if="{{comment.providerMode === 'mock'}}" class="reply-label"> · Mock 演示</text><text wx:if="{{comment.replyToCommentId}}" class="reply-label"> · 回复</text></view><view class="comment-content">{{comment.content}}</view><view class="comment-tools"><text data-id="{{item.id}}" data-comment="{{comment.id}}" bindtap="addComment">回复</text><text wx:if="{{comment.authorType === 'ai'}}" data-comment="{{comment.id}}" bindtap="commentMenu">隐藏 / 反馈</text></view></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!posts.length && !loading}}" class="empty-card"><view class="empty-icon">🌱</view><view class="empty-title">留一条自然小事吧</view><view class="empty-text">纯文字也可以。个人观察需要你主动分享后才会公开。</view></view>
    <view class="pagination"><button size="mini" bindtap="firstPage">回到最新</button><button wx:if="{{nextCursor}}" size="mini" bindtap="nextPage">下一页</button></view>
  </block>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="notice">本机记录，尚未公开。原有点赞和评论仍只保存在此设备。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{localPosts}}" wx:key="id" class="post-card">
      <view class="username">{{item.speciesName}} · 本机观察</view><view class="post-time">{{item.time}}</view>
      <image wx:if="{{item.imagePath}}" class="post-image" src="{{item.imagePath}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="post-content">{{item.locationName || '观察地点'}} · 模拟识别结果经用户确认</view>
      <view class="interaction-row"><view data-id="{{item.id}}" data-type="like" bindtap="localInteraction">{{item.liked ? '♥' : '♡'}} {{item.likeCount}}</view><view data-id="{{item.id}}" data-type="seen" bindtap="localInteraction">我也见过 {{item.seenCount}}</view><view data-id="{{item.id}}" data-type="comment" bindtap="localInteraction">本机评论</view></view>
      <view wx:for="{{item.comments}}" wx:for-item="comment" wx:key="id" class="comment-content">{{comment.username}}：{{comment.content}}</view>
      <button class="publish" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="shareLocal">补充文字并分享到发现</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!localPosts.length}}" class="empty-card">还没有本机观察。可以先在广场聊聊自然。</view>
  </block>
</view>
